cking-widest uppercase mb-1">BLIND TYPE — Hidden zones</p><p class="font-sans text-indb-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed"><span class="text-indb-white font-bold">blind_payload</span> is zero-knowledge encrypted storage. The intelligence layer <span class="text-indb-white font-bold">never sees its contents</span> — it is stored, replicated and queried as an opaque blob. ChaCha20 encryption. No key stored on server. Like memories we store but cannot consciously access. </p></div></div></section>
